            "detailed_description": "WARPSQUAD is a space exploration rogue-lite in an ever-changing galaxy to be played solo or co-op. Encounter a wide range of hostile spaceships, special events, and upgrades to your ship and crew. Master the ship terminals and crew with unique traits to survive this hostile world.<br><br>Take control of a spaceship crew and explore the universe, upgrading your ship and crew in preparation for the final battle.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take control of a spaceship and crew, alone or with a friend.<br></li><li>Navigate an ever-changing path to victory full of danger and opportunity.<br></li><li>Upgrade your ship and crew with a unique and large set of Ship Augments &amp; Crew Mutations.<br></li><li>Optimize your strategy against a wide range of combat encounters.<br></li><li>Make important decisions through text-based Events and in-world Scenarios that have a deep-influence on your playthrough.<br></li><li>Real-time with Pause lets you take a break from the chaos to re-plan your strategy in combat.<br></li><li>Death is permanent, and each playthrough is unique with procedural encounters and events.</li></ul>",
